    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\njump2d\n\n### Description\n\nSimilar to hop's `hint_char1` function, let the user type in the first character of the spot that the user wants to jump to. This usually decrease the number of keystrokes required for the jump and allow the user to jump to any position in the buffer as long as he/she can type the character at that position.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2286687/196723115-adfb9bfc-56bc-4742-bf5d-5537941250af.png)\r\n",
