        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yes, thank you! That is what I was looking for. For anybody looking for the same thing:\r\n\r\n```\r\nlocal mini_jump2d = require('mini.jump2d')\r\nmini_jump2d.setup({\r\n  mappings = {\r\n    start_jumping = '',\r\n  },\r\n})\r\nvim.keymap.set({ \"n\", \"v\" }, \"<cr>\",\r\n  function() return mini_jump2d.start(mini_jump2d.builtin_opts.single_character) end, keymap_opts)\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2022-10-19T16:00:37Z",
